{
  "project_id": 21,
  "project_label": "gemma",
  "task_id": 8545,
  "title": "The brain science of obesity",
  "author": "Mads Tang-Christensen",
  "url": "https://www.ted.com/talks/mads_tang_christensen_the_brain_science_of_obesity",
  "annotation_id": null,
  "completed_by": 7,
  "created_at": "2026-05-07T02:51:49.948026Z",
  "updated_at": "2026-05-07T02:51:49.948026Z",
  "lead_time": 69.715,
  "result": [
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "0",
        "end": "0",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 22,
        "text": "Have you ever wondered",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "FC83CB6572",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "0",
        "end": "0",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 172,
        "text": "Have you ever wondered why a pair of siblings living in the same house with the same parents, with the same food, sometimes end up in opposite sides of the weight spectrum?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "9643DACBAA",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "1",
        "end": "1",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 107,
        "text": "My name is Mads and for the last 25 years, I've been studying what we eat, when we eat and how much we eat.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "04293C00FD",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "2",
        "end": "2",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 143,
        "text": "And probably more importantly, I've been studying how each of our unique bodies responds differently to the same food and the same environment.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "3C029532D3",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "3",
        "end": "3",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 36,
        "text": "To be more precise, I study obesity.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "D75137112E",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "4",
        "end": "4",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 103,
        "text": "During my training as an MD, PhD, I was very fascinated by a series of experiments done by Barry Levin.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "40A1AE7650",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "5",
        "end": "5",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 56,
        "text": "He took 100 rats and subjected them to high-fat feeding.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "22CD71A062",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "6",
        "end": "6",
        "startOffset": 44,
        "endOffset": 61,
        "text": "bell-shaped curve",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "79E69DFDD7",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "6",
        "end": "6",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 153,
        "text": "After months of feeding, he ended up with a bell-shaped curve and a weight distribution with some skinny rats and some obese rats and some in the middle.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "FECAC6DC8B",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "7",
        "end": "7",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 97,
        "text": "What he then did was to take the skinny rats and breed them among themselves, and the heavy rats.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "C6FBFF5631",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "8",
        "end": "8",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 35,
        "text": "And he bred those among themselves.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "2D8B713835",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "9",
        "end": "9",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 119,
        "text": "And after rounds of breeding, he ended up with two distinct populations: a diet-resistant rat and an obesity-prone rat.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "BA3EA3C2A3",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "10",
        "end": "10",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 39,
        "text": "And here's the really interesting part.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "D2671F8F64",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "11",
        "end": "11",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 82,
        "text": "Then he took the skinny or the obese, and either massively over- or underfed them.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "9501A37079",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "12",
        "end": "12",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 83,
        "text": "And their weight would, of course, go up and down depending on the dietary regimen.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "9120298B3C",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "13",
        "end": "13",
        "startOffset": 11,
        "endOffset": 80,
        "text": "as if the little bodies would remember the same old weight trajectory",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "78A89D9AAD",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "14",
        "end": "14",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 99,
        "text": "So once the dietary regimen was stopped, the rats went right back to the initial weight trajectory.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "F0E44B6FE0",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "15",
        "end": "15",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 80,
        "text": "It was like as if you could dress up the obese rat in a skinny sheep's clothing.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "A5ED97A2DC",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "15",
        "end": "15",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 80,
        "text": "It was like as if you could dress up the obese rat in a skinny sheep's clothing.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "BC57969ED4",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "16",
        "end": "16",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 57,
        "text": "But the obese rat nature was still scratching to get out.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "5BE259F7B7",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "17",
        "end": "17",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 33,
        "text": "The same thing applies to humans.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "54C983EF4C",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "17",
        "end": "17",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 33,
        "text": "The same thing applies to humans.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "103062E923",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "18",
        "end": "18",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 105,
        "text": "If you take a thousand kids and weigh them, their weight will also be distributed in a bell-shaped curve.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "55E4405D03",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "19",
        "end": "19",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 47,
        "text": "Some skinny, some in the middle and some heavy.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "2F59138F48",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "20",
        "end": "20",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 132,
        "text": "We know that some of the skinny kids will remain skinny throughout life, and some of the obese kids will stay obese throughout life.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "E29AA550AF",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "21",
        "end": "21",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 74,
        "text": "You could argue that their weight, to some degree, has been predetermined.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "3B6B82EBFF",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "21",
        "end": "21",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 74,
        "text": "You could argue that their weight, to some degree, has been predetermined.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "4DB8552BFB",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "22",
        "end": "22",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 47,
        "text": "You could also argue that obesity is a disease.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "7AC7331340",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "22",
        "end": "22",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 47,
        "text": "You could also argue that obesity is a disease.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "8C8A377B3F",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "23",
        "end": "23",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 44,
        "text": "Wait, did I just say that obesity a disease?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "HUMOR"
        ]
      },
      "id": "FC8A43385E",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "23",
        "end": "23",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 44,
        "text": "Wait, did I just say that obesity a disease?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "689FE8B709",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "24",
        "end": "24",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 4,
        "text": "Yes.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "5AE46337C7",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "25",
        "end": "25",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 50,
        "text": "There's actually data and science that shows that.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "CDFD7985D1",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "26",
        "end": "26",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 106,
        "text": "And I've made it my audacious life goal to come up with a solution to prevent, treat or even cure obesity.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "HUMOR"
        ]
      },
      "id": "3E4240AC40",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "26",
        "end": "26",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 106,
        "text": "And I've made it my audacious life goal to come up with a solution to prevent, treat or even cure obesity.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "05A56886CA",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "27",
        "end": "27",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 15,
        "text": "Let me explain.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "E32D3BA983",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "28",
        "end": "28",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 183,
        "text": "In the early 1980s and 1990s, obesity was considered a potential global problem, a global problem of a magnitude that led WHO in the end of 1990s to declare obesity a global pandemic.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "E8742EF9F0",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "29",
        "end": "29",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 42,
        "text": "And I probably don't have to tell you why.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "C5F56E08EF",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "29",
        "end": "29",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 42,
        "text": "And I probably don't have to tell you why.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "F2E93D1D67",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "30",
        "end": "30",
        "startOffset": 104,
        "endOffset": 114,
        "text": "clear link",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "B14853E246",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "30",
        "end": "30",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 155,
        "text": "Higher rates of diabetes, hypertension, cardiovascular disease, even some cancers, osteoarthritis and a clear link to mental conditions such as depression.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "C0DF6BE56E",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "31",
        "end": "31",
        "startOffset": 44,
        "endOffset": 50,
        "text": "so did",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "0039D9DC29",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "31",
        "end": "31",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 102,
        "text": "So as the number of obese individuals grew, so did the number of people suffering from these diseases.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "FEB8C1099A",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "32",
        "end": "32",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 93,
        "text": "Today, more than 50 percent of the US adult population are living with obesity or overweight.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "95B10015CC",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "33",
        "end": "33",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 47,
        "text": "From a health perspective, that is devastating.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "95AD6FA9AE",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "34",
        "end": "34",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 31,
        "text": "But it's not only a US problem.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "AC6CD3555B",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "35",
        "end": "35",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 59,
        "text": "The obesity surge has made obesity a global health problem.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "00B86516AB",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "36",
        "end": "36",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 79,
        "text": "Many inside and outside the medical community believe obesity is not a disease.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "7FD4513C5D",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "37",
        "end": "37",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 111,
        "text": "They believe that obesity is a condition, a condition brought about by too much eating and too little exercise.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "73641159D2",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "38",
        "end": "38",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 72,
        "text": "As a matter of fact, a lot of people living with obesity think that too.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "F8719F7A02",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "39",
        "end": "39",
        "startOffset": 168,
        "endOffset": 181,
        "text": "heartbreaking",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "F305A2281A",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "39",
        "end": "39",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 212,
        "text": "They believe that their weight is 100 percent their own fault, which can lead to self-blame and low self-esteem, and perhaps even shame or stress eating, which is both heartbreaking, as well as counterproductive.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "3016F10059",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "40",
        "end": "40",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 60,
        "text": "But where is the scientific proof that obesity is a disease?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "607802B21A",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "41",
        "end": "41",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 103,
        "text": "Well, medically speaking, there's many ways to define disease, but let me give you just three examples.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "869203BC9A",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "42",
        "end": "42",
        "startOffset": 85,
        "endOffset": 90,
        "text": "check",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "6720138231",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "42",
        "end": "42",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 91,
        "text": "As a process that impairs your functionality and reduces life expectancy -- obesity, check.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "7102583F73",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "43",
        "end": "43",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 105,
        "text": "You can define disease as a process that leaves you more susceptible to other diseases or causes disease.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "7FD58CDB57",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "44",
        "end": "44",
        "startOffset": 9,
        "endOffset": 14,
        "text": "check",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "A83547FC47",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "44",
        "end": "44",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 15,
        "text": "Obesity, check.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "2B6233C9BB",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "45",
        "end": "45",
        "startOffset": 87,
        "endOffset": 105,
        "text": "like, for instance",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "E3CBD4865A",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "45",
        "end": "45",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 10,
        "text": "Or you can",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "6FC8A38BC7",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "46",
        "end": "46",
        "startOffset": 73,
        "endOffset": 94,
        "text": "such as, for instance",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "35A8809B53",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "47",
        "end": "47",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 48,
        "text": "We also have two-three genes leading to obesity.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "98D18FFCCB",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "48",
        "end": "48",
        "startOffset": 28,
        "endOffset": 48,
        "text": "we, by the year 2030",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "9E8EB72F9C",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "49",
        "end": "49",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 47,
        "text": "So obesity as a disease by this measure, check.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "E0E8D5C397",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "50",
        "end": "50",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 16,
        "text": "Let me be clear.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "E4868FD5F6",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "51",
        "end": "51",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 46,
        "text": "We humans have had the same genes for decades.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "F10E9DDC79",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "52",
        "end": "52",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 55,
        "text": "And just recently, obesity has become a bigger problem.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "D7B02635C3",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "53",
        "end": "53",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 28,
        "text": "How do we then explain that?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "63655ACDBB",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "54",
        "end": "54",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 103,
        "text": "One obvious thing is actually food, especially calorie-rich food, which is much more readily available.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "7DAE51D26F",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "55",
        "end": "55",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 123,
        "text": "It's relatively easy and also relatively cheap to eat your entire daily need of calories by a fast food or big soft drinks.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "6AA1F788BB",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "56",
        "end": "56",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 68,
        "text": "So genes do play a role, but the environment also plays a huge role.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "06DE8C4978",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "57",
        "end": "57",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 120,
        "text": "The overabundance of calories in certain communities is a relatively new thing, and our genes haven't quite adapted yet.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "D366839FFA",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "58",
        "end": "58",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 114,
        "text": "In the history of feast and famine, genetic selection has prepared us much better for famine, and for good reason.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "AA734B354D",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "59",
        "end": "59",
        "startOffset": 19,
        "endOffset": 58,
        "text": "but you could also argue obesity is bad",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "HUMOR"
        ]
      },
      "id": "2BDEABA489",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "60",
        "end": "60",
        "startOffset": 29,
        "endOffset": 75,
        "text": "how do we then prevent, treat or even cure it?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "66D0E66670",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "60",
        "end": "60",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 75,
        "text": "And if obesity is a disease, how do we then prevent, treat or even cure it?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "543DA9081B",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "61",
        "end": "61",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 39,
        "text": "I believe that the brain holds the key.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "8928B87DAF",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "62",
        "end": "62",
        "startOffset": 95,
        "endOffset": 125,
        "text": "lead to big behavioral changes",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "04D3112552",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "62",
        "end": "62",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 126,
        "text": "I have always been fascinated with how small electrical signals in discrete parts of the brain lead to big behavioral changes.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "1183C46C2A",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "63",
        "end": "63",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 80,
        "text": "And my study of the brain led me to Glucagon-Like Peptide 1, or GLP-1 for short.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "81EDB39E5C",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "64",
        "end": "64",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 91,
        "text": "GLP-1 is a hormone and a signal molecule that is produced both in the gut and in the brain.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "E327FDD694",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "65",
        "end": "65",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 60,
        "text": "The brain speaks to the gut and the gut speaks to the brain.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "7DB90E2E0C",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "65",
        "end": "65",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 60,
        "text": "The brain speaks to the gut and the gut speaks to the brain.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "0331350B69",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "66",
        "end": "66",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 18,
        "text": "Yes, that's right.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "2C33665626",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "67",
        "end": "67",
        "startOffset": 30,
        "endOffset": 49,
        "text": "literally connected",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "1F5D96DA99",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "67",
        "end": "67",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 50,
        "text": "Your belly and your brain are literally connected.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "70ECD9C491",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "68",
        "end": "68",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 119,
        "text": "Our research led us to see that GLP-1 has an effect on nerve cells sitting in areas that control whether we eat or not.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "381B618C94",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "69",
        "end": "69",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 110,
        "text": "So, for instance, if we increase the level of GLP-1, the body's desire to eat or overeat food gets turned off.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "0DCC4F471F",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "70",
        "end": "70",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 55,
        "text": "GLP-1 serves as the full signal in your car's gas tank.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "2628915710",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "70",
        "end": "70",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 55,
        "text": "GLP-1 serves as the full signal in your car's gas tank.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "AD938297EF",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "71",
        "end": "71",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 125,
        "text": "I've spent years and decades mapping the circuitry of GLP-1 and how GLP-1 interacts with other signal molecules and hormones.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "FA3104C01A",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "72",
        "end": "72",
        "startOffset": 36,
        "endOffset": 103,
        "text": "control food intake, body weight and the control of eating behavior",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "F3B3792E15",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "72",
        "end": "72",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 104,
        "text": "All of these things go together and control food intake, body weight and the control of eating behavior.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "7B70FC91D5",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "73",
        "end": "73",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 28,
        "text": "And what does that all mean?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "A967A536D5",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "73",
        "end": "73",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 28,
        "text": "And what does that all mean?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "66C1ED4E03",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "74",
        "end": "74",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 127,
        "text": "Well, today, we have engineered and studied the molecule, so we now have a molecule that can lead to a significant weight loss.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "F1231D1BF0",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "75",
        "end": "75",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 41,
        "text": "Obviously, GLP-1 is not the whole answer.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "AF8F66F690",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "76",
        "end": "76",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 147,
        "text": "We and others have discovered numerous hormones and other signal molecules that are also pivotal for the regulation of food intake and body weight.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "3E979E7719",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "77",
        "end": "77",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 94,
        "text": "And it may end up that these signal molecules and hormones are even more important than GLP-1.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "F44BE8F8EF",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "78",
        "end": "78",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 6,
        "text": "So ...",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "3C21B63D56",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "79",
        "end": "79",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 28,
        "text": "There's plenty for us to do.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "C597C4565E",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "80",
        "end": "80",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 39,
        "text": "There's still plenty for us to explore.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "C1651D9A26",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "81",
        "end": "81",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 23,
        "text": "So this is not the end.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "BF51946D0F",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "82",
        "end": "82",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 39,
        "text": "It's not even the beginning to the end.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "HUMOR"
        ]
      },
      "id": "0E38C9E34A",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "83",
        "end": "83",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 49,
        "text": "But perhaps this may be the end to the beginning.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "HUMOR"
        ]
      },
      "id": "603940753F",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "84",
        "end": "84",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 103,
        "text": "We may have a massive weight crisis on the planet today, but the good news is we are on the right path.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "E10825DB2D",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "85",
        "end": "85",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 158,
        "text": "We now have solutions for people living with obesity, and the next steps will be to understand even better the problems people living with obesity are facing.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "C9E46BBF87",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "86",
        "end": "86",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 66,
        "text": "To understand even better how genes and environment play together.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "1AFD9C3DDF",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "87",
        "end": "87",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 90,
        "text": "And understand, finally, how all these things come together and determine our body weight.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "7079D1BE0E",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "88",
        "end": "88",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 182,
        "text": "Then, and maybe just then, we will be able to come up with a prevention, a treatment or even a cure for people living with obesity, like we strive for with any other chronic disease.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "0ECC381178",
